# Drop trained model artefacts here:
#
#   regressor.joblib   — sklearn-style BaseEfficiencyPredictor (knn / dt / linear)
#   q_network.npz      — LinearQNetwork weights (np.savez of w, b, state_dim)
#
# After dropping new files in, hit POST /api/v1/projects/{id}/admin/reload-models
# (ADMIN+) to refresh the in-memory ModelRegistry without restarting uvicorn.
#
# When neither file is present, the assignment endpoint falls back to a
# heuristic policy so the API stays usable from day one.
